    "explanation": "The correct answer is norepinephrine. Of all the autonomic\ndrugs listed, only β1 and β2 adrenergic agonists work by\nstimulating adenylate cyclase. Norepinephrine is a β1 agonist,\nso it activates this pathway.\nIn contrast:\nClonidine is an α2 adrenergic agonist,\nPhentolamine is an α1 adrenergic antagonist,\nPhenylephrine is an α1 adrenergic agonist, and",
