    "explanation": "Troponin is a complex of three subunits, each playing a\nspecific role in controlling muscle contraction:\n• Troponin C allows the binding of actin to myosin by\nexposing the myosin-binding sites.\n• Troponin I inhibits the binding of actin to myosin.\n• Troponin T attaches tropomyosin to the troponin\ncomplex.",
