    "stem": "6. A 34 year old female came in for complaints of\ndrowning after their banca sank during an island\nhopping escapade in Cebu. On ABG: PaO2/ FiO2 ratio\nwas only 150. Patient was then intubated. Which of\nthe following is true of ventilation - perfusion ratio?",
