    "id": "superexam-physiology-0088",
    "subject": "physiology",
    "originalNumber": 88,
    "stem": "8. During a mountain trek in Mount Bulusan, Dr. JCT\nfound a child with an opaque cornea and difficulty\nseeing at night. Which of the following is true of the\nexcitation of rods?",
