    "explanation": "Simple and facilitated diffusion does not require\nmetabolic energy (non-ATP requiring). Stereospecificity,\nsaturation and competition are characteristics of carrier-\nmediated transport. Simple diffusion is the only\ntransport mechanism that is not carrier-mediated.\nPrimary active transport requires direct input of\nmetabolic enery in the form of ATP.",
