    "subject": "physiology",
    "originalNumber": 174,
    "stem": "A curious 3 year old male was playing his eyes by\npressing his thumb on both his eyes. A few seconds\nlater, he experienced syncope. The paramedics who\nsaw him first reported that patient had a very slow\nheart rate. Which of the following was stimulated to\nthe child?",
