    "subject": "physiology",
    "originalNumber": 289,
    "stem": "A 17 year old male who is being treated with\nerythromycin complains of nausea, intestinal\ncramping and diarrhea. The side effects are the\nresult of stimulation of enteric nerves and smooth\nmuscle cells that recognize which hormone?",
