    "explanation": "Must memorize several values; they are asked. Water\nloss from the skin and feces remain constant even during\nprolonged heavy exercise, set at 350 and 100 ml/day,\nrespectively. On the other hand, loss from respiration\nincreases from 350 to 650 ml/day; sweat - from 100 to\n5000 ml/day. Urine finally decreases from 1400 to as\nlittle as 500 ml/day.",
