    "explanation": "Poiseuille's Law states that Blood flow is directly\nproportional to pressure difference, radius of the vessel\nand inversely proportional to fliud viscosity and length\nof the vessel (determinants of resistance). So to decrease\nflow, we should increase the determinants of resistance.",
